Set Proton profile for a game

Usage:
  spela proton set <game> [flags]

Flags:
      --hdr string           Enable HDR (true/false)
  -h, --help                 help for set
      --ngx-updater string   Enable NGX auto-updater (true/false)
      --vkd3d-heap string    Enable VKD3D descriptor heap path (true/false)
      --wayland string       Enable native Wayland (true/false)
